  "ingredients": [
    "4 cups fresh blackberries",
    "0.75 cup white sugar, divided",
    "0.5 cup all-purpose flour",
    "1 (9 inch) double crust ready-to-use pie crust",
    "2 tablespoons milk"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 425 degrees F (220 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/aQPs3rxtXAvSaVmrMvygMMRpRvU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-12284-blackberry-pie-i-DDMFS-4x3-step-01-9d888bc963524f27a6a0f08e1693e37f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12284/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine 3 ½ cups of blackberries with 1/2 cup sugar and flour in a large bowl. Spoon mixture into the unbaked pie crust. Spread remaining 1/2 cup of blackberries on top of sweetened berries.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vPeO_LDAsOCgtmBsdJDZh15Jbo8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-12284-blackberry-pie-i-DDMFS-4x3-step-02-13d84343034b48978b14438840206448.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12284/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cover with the top crust. Seal and crimp the edges, and cut vents in the top crust for steam to escape.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8KAQYdF7sgWck9KzWLzLLwJn0ac=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-12284-blackberry-pie-i-DDMFS-4x3-step-03-5a6b41cbc784435cbfb3e3126cf7ac4b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12284/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Brush the top crust with milk and sprinkle with remaining 1/4 cup sugar.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ANXDYTD1ba6ffuOe0kvhQ1hEf2s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-12284-blackberry-pie-i-DDMFS-4x3-step-04-e54b0d0570a54b45a34905c9ec5ce6ee.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12284/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake pie in the preheated oven for 15 minutes. Reduce the temperature of the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C) and bake until filling is bubbly and crust is golden brown, an additional 20 to 25 minutes. Cool on wire rack.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/DN12c1-pvF3o0PGOOR35lMw2gkc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-12284-blackberry-pie-i-DDMFS-4x3-step-05-b64d655762e340bdba20b957fcad1912.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12284/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
